### Get all tickets (from MongoDB)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets

###

### Get one ticket by ID (replace with a real _id from the response above)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/6a60af167d65ebee03480705

###

### Get missing ticket (valid ObjectId format, but does not exist)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/000000000000000000000000

###

### Create a new ticket
POST http://localhost:8081/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Printer not working",
  "description": "Office printer on Level 3 is not responding.",
  "category": "Hardware",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "createdBy": "farah@example.com"
}

### Create invalid ticket (empty fields, expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "",
  "category": "",
  "priority": "",
  "createdBy": ""
}